 ```
 
+`HAPI_DSH_ACP_CONFIG` maps to `--config` for the configured server. Without
+`HAPI_DSH_ACP_COMMAND` it instead applies to the official CLI, which has no
+`--config` flag — the path is passed as a `--patch` overlay on top of
+`--profile acp`.
+
